      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALL GRUNT (2) missed narrowly two back before backing up the next week in the Kalgoorlie Cup where he was sound. Back to this level suits and the Norton bit goes on now. Noske hopping back on board is a bonus and he can bounce back to winning ways. ABISSI (4) missed two back before running away with an impressive win over this track and trip last time out. Parnham sticks and if he can slot into the running line, he can bring up back-to-back wins. I LOVE YA MONEY (7) was solid stepping up to 1800m last start and he rises again to 2200m on the quick turnaround. He draws to get every chance from the barrier and with no weight on his back, he can go one better. ARCADIA KNIGHT (1) steps right out to 2200m now. Wouldn't surprise to see him back at his best. STARWALKER (6) can feature on his recent form.",
